a-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-60_">If you will be away during the time of shipping, you can re-route your shipment to an address (within Portugal), that will be able to receive it on your behalf. Simply log in and edit shipping details for current shipment.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kpDprT ifeEKM pf-61_"><button type="button" class="sc-imWZod yQSGW pf-62_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="cf441e8b-8b0b-42a6-b45d-b8b657dc1fc6" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I change the address my wine is shipped to?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="cf441e8b-8b0b-42a6-b45d-b8b657dc1fc6" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-jXbVAB fMPMgo pf-64_"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-65_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-66_"><p class="sc-feopBa gVincu pf-67_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-69_">If you have moved or would like to permanently change your shipping address you can do this by logging in to your account and editing the shipping address (within Portugal).</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kpDprT ifeEKM pf-70_"><button type="button" class="sc-imWZod yQSGW pf-71_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="5db8b657-dc1f-4602-a052-bf4503ec4f3a" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I add more wine to my package?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="5db8b657-dc1f-4602-a052-bf4503ec4f3a" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-jXbVAB fMPMgo pf-73_"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-74_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row